      "id": "claim_4d35ef18e37546058eddef8f641d9e57",
      "statement": "Local dev uses docker-compose.dev.yml which runs pgvector/pgvector:pg16 (Postgres + vector extension for FAQ embeddings) on port 5440, redis:7-alpine on port 6390, and adminer on port 8081, with healthchecks gating dependent services and a named tingting-pgdata volume for state across make down/up cycles.",
