      "statement": "Deploy targets build and push images to Docker Hub with docker buildx (builder bb, linux/amd64, inline registry cache), tagging each image both :latest and the short HEAD sha; backend/.env supplies the Docker Hub credentials and the frontend Makefile shares it via include ../backend/.env.",
